$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=psiaporthu  LOC_AFTER=?

* Character orthogonality for psi in a residue class, with the inverse supplied: for A coprime to Q there is an integer b inverse to A mod Q for which psiAP is the character average weighted at b (Lean: psiAP_eq_inv_totient_mul_sum_psiChar).

