i17::psiaporth
s18:s16,s15,s14,i17:syl3anc |- ( ( ( ( ( Q e. NN /\ A e. ZZ /\ ( A gcd Q ) = 1 ) /\ Y e. RR ) /\ b e. ZZ ) /\ Q || ( ( A x. b ) - 1 ) ) -> ( A ( psiAP ` Q ) Y ) = ( ( 1 / ( phi ` Q ) ) x. sum_ x e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` Q ) ) ( ( x ` ( ( ZRHom ` ( Z/nZ ` Q ) ) ` b ) ) x. ( x ( psiChar ` Q ) Y ) ) ) )
